<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round results in the $1 million Stuttgart clay-court men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 14-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 1-6 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>10-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat 8-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 4-1 (Kuerten withdrew injured)</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovaquia) beat 5-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>3-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 3-6 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>12-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>9-Albert Costa (Spain) beat 7-Boris Becker (Germany), walkover (Becker withdrew injured before the start of the match)</p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 4-6 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
